Subject: [PATCH] themes_web v1.5.0: Ignition Watch page + daily scan

New standalone ignition/ module scans the S&P 500+400 (903 stocks)
weekdays 17:00 ET for the momentum-ignition signal (+12% 5-day return on
1.5x volume, 50-DMA > 200-DMA). Backtest 2016-2026: 26.9% of fires traded
+40% within 63 sessions vs 4.6% baseline, positive in 10 of 11 years.

themes_web gains /ignition (fire log with NEW/+40% badges, near misses,
RS leaders), GET /api/ignition, POST /api/refresh_ignition, a nav link,
and scheduler jobs (weekday cron + boot scan when data is missing, since
the Railway disk is wiped on redeploy). Runs by subprocess only, keeping
the no-cross-import rule.

